10  REM  SP0256-AL2 ALLOPHONE SWEEP
20  REM  ALL 64 SOUNDS, PACED BY THE
30  REM  DATASHEET DURATION SO THE SCREEN
40  REM  STAYS WITH THE AUDIO. THE CARD
50  REM  BUFFERS 4096 ALLOPHONES, SO THE
60  REM  WAITS ARE FOR YOUR EYES, NOT IT.
70  SL = 4: REM  CARD SLOT
80  SP =  - 16256 + 16 * SL
